   "fixing_commit_message": "Don't add a trailing comma in lists that shouldn't have one.\n\nType parameter and type argument lists don't allow trailing commas. The\nformatter is generally good about not adding them, but it would get\ntripped up if the list ended with comments (which are treated like\nseparate elements in the list). This fixes that bug.\n\nFix #1639.",
